[al:Ṛwaḥ Ṛwaḥ]
[length:6:03]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:32.62] Ad tili lḥaǧa rxiset
[00:36.82] Ṭṭeṛṛifen seg-s akk medden
[00:40.86] Mi qeṛṛbeɣ ɣur-s ay ɣlayet
[00:45.00] Ay ur ẓṛiɣ ayen
[00:48.54] Ad tili lḥaǧa rxiset
[00:52.39] Ṭṭeṛṛifen seg-s akk medden
[00:56.63] Mi qeṛṛbeɣ ɣur-s ay ɣlayet
[01:00.36] Ay ur ẓṛiɣ ayen
[01:03.64]
[01:19.73] Xeddmeɣ ittader uḍellaɛ
[01:23.54] Ssebba ur tt-ẓṛiɣ
[01:27.61] Ansi i yi-d-yekka waya
[01:31.70] Ar ass-a ur t-ufiɣ
[01:35.36] Ṛṛcac leɣman d usigna
[01:39.18] Si zzman d nutni i dduriɣ
[01:43.33] Daɛwessu n baba d yemma
[01:47.22] Deg yijifer i tt-ttawiɣ
[01:51.06] Ad tili lḥaǧa rxiset
[01:54.66] Ṭṭeṛṛifen seg-s akk medden
[01:59.04] Mi qeṛṛbeɣ ɣur-s ay ɣlayet
[02:02.83] Ay ur ẓṛiɣ ayen
[02:05.84]
[02:21.62] Melmi akka ara yi-tsemmḥem
[02:25.53] Ay imawlan-iw
[02:29.41] Daɛwessu melmi ara tt-tekksem
[02:33.25] Ɣef uqerru-iw
[02:37.25] Teqqur tejra n usirem
[02:41.19] Ass mi akken rǧiɣ leḥqq-iw
[02:45.17] Zedmen-tt rran-tt d isɣaṛen
[02:49.12] Iɛzizen n wul-iw
[02:53.06] Ad tili lḥaǧa rxiset
[02:56.39] Ṭṭeṛṛifen seg-s akk medden
[03:00.55] Mi qeṛṛbeɣ ɣur-s ay ɣlayet
[03:04.34] Ay ur ẓṛiɣ ayen
[03:07.55]
[03:23.08] Ur ssineɣ ad xtireɣ
[03:27.10] Anwi i d iḥbiben-iw
[03:31.39] Ur ssineɣ ad ten-ferqeɣ
[03:35.26] Nitni d yiɛdawen-iw
[03:39.16] Deg ugni n lmuḥal kecmeɣ
[03:42.92] Ccah, ccah di ṛṛay-iw
[03:46.87] Xas ass-a bɣiɣ ad d-ffɣeɣ
[03:50.73] Teǧǧa-yi temẓi-w
[03:54.55] Ad tili lḥaǧa rxiset
[03:58.07] Ṭṭeṛṛifen seg-s akk medden
[04:02.34] Mi qeṛṛbeɣ ɣur-s ay ɣlayet
[04:06.32] Ay ur ẓṛiɣ ayen
[04:09.19]
[04:25.24] Yenǧer yiẓṛi-w tiregwa
[04:28.96] Ffɣent ɣer wul-iw
[04:32.87] Sswent aẓaṛ n lmeḥna
[04:36.62] Xerben lecɣal-iw
[04:40.58] A wid iferrun tilla
[04:44.31] Ttxilwat frut tamsalt-iw
[04:48.49] Di lǧib-iw mi d-yella kra
[04:52.21] Ad t-yaker ufus-iw
